# LOM Pipeline Implementation Walkthrough

## What Was Built

A complete **Logging, Monitoring & Observability (LOM)** data processing pipeline for Root Cause Analysis (RCA), running as a separate system alongside the existing CSV pipeline.

---

## Architecture

```mermaid
flowchart LR
    subgraph Upload
        A[".json .log .py .csv .yaml"] --> B["lom_parser.py"]
    end
    subgraph "LOM Pipeline (LangGraph)"
        B --> C["LOM Profiler"]
        C --> D["LOM Timeline"]
        D --> E["LOM RCA"]
        E --> F["LOM Report"]
    end
    subgraph Storage
        C --> G["LOM_GAL.json"]
        D --> G
        E --> G
        F --> G
    end
    subgraph "Untouched"
        H["GAL.json (CSV)"]
    end
```

