---

## API Endpoints

| Endpoint | Method | Purpose |
|----------|--------|---------|
| `/{id}/upload-lom` | POST | Upload .json, .log, .py, .csv, .yaml files |
| `/{id}/execute/lom-profile` | POST | Parse + profile logs/metrics |
| `/{id}/execute/lom-timeline` | POST | Timeline + anomaly detection + RCA |
| `/{id}/execute/lom-rca` | POST | Standalone RCA re-run |
| `/{id}/execute/lom-report` | POST | Final RCA narrative report |
| `/{id}/lom-gal` | GET | Retrieve LOM_GAL state |

